+/**
+ * OpenAI Chat Completions content parts only accept `text` (and `image_url`).
+ * Anthropic-style `{ type: "thinking" }` fails on DeepSeek's OpenAI-compatible
+ * endpoint (`https://api.deepseek.com`) with:
+ *   unknown variant `thinking`, expected `text`
+ * Strip those parts from outbound history. Stored SDK/DB messages are unchanged.
+ *
+ * Do not delete top-level `reasoning_content`. Legacy deepseek-reasoner rejected
+ * that field on input, but DeepSeek V4 thinking mode requires it on subsequent
+ * requests that carry `tools` (Open Cowork always does). Omitting it 400s with
+ * "reasoning_content in the thinking mode must be passed back".
